{"id": "86187", "name": "הוצאת גורם משותף – סוגריים משותפים x(y+a) − b(y+a) (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Factorise the following:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Both terms contain the same bracket. Treat the bracket as a single quantity and take it out as a common factor.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The common factor</b><br>The terms are \\({{CT:1}}\\) and \\({{CT:2}}\\). Both contain the bracket \\(\\left({{CT:3}}\\right)\\). There is no need to expand the compond term \\({{CT:3}}\\) as you can treat it as a single variable and carry out the task quicker: writing \\(B={{CT:3}}\\), the expression is<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ x\\,B-{{CT:4}}\\,B \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Taking out the bracket</b><br>The common factor of \\(x\\,B\\) and \\({{CT:5}}\\,B\\) is \\(B\\):<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ x\\,B-{{CT:4}}\\,B=B\\left(x-{{CT:4}}\\right) \\]</p>Substituting back \\(B={{CT:3}}\\) and checking by expanding:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\left({{CT:3}}\\right)\\left({{CT:6}}\\right)=x\\left({{CT:3}}\\right)-{{CT:4}}\\left({{CT:3}}\\right)\\ \\checkmark \\]</p>So the factorised form is<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}={{CT:7}}. \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "factor", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "FacForm", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": "x", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["k1", "k2", "ta"], "nvariants": 50}